Package: bloomr
Title: Interactive Hierarchical Geographic Bloom Maps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("George", "Arthur", , "prigasgenthian48@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1975-1459"))
Description: Creates interactive maps that spread geographic areas apart
    while preserving their original locations with dots and dotted
    connector lines.  Includes prepared New Jersey and Texas examples and
    accepts custom polygon boundaries through an optional 'sf' interface.
    Supports numeric indicators, selection, dragging, and reactive 'Shiny'
    updates. Light styling is the default, with optional dark mode and a
    portable mode for standalone 'HTML' reports.
